{"translation":{"id":"fra_jnd","name":"Bible J.N. Darby","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=frajnd","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=frajnd","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"JND","englishName":"French: Bible J.N. Darby","language":"fra","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"121a3f4841e42965f22ebebcf5a8578a12578ec30eaf1ca7ae4e46d5d85ccb80","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/fra_jnd/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31170,"languageName":"français","languageEnglishName":"French"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"fra_jnd","name":"Les Psaumes","commonName":"Les Psaumes","title":"Les Psaumes","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"4c48a766d24644f7ef347ae1395ef8ddb5d363cc30acf1733162d22f071b120e","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/fra_jnd/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/fra_jnd/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2527},"chapter":{"number":110,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"De David. Psaume. L’Éternel a dit à mon Seigneur : Assieds-toi à ma droite, jusqu’à ce que je mette tes ennemis pour le marchepied de tes pieds.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"L’Éternel enverra de Sion la verge","poem":1},{"noteId":344},{"text":"de ta force : Domine au milieu de tes ennemis !","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Ton peuple sera [un peuple] de franche volonté, au jour de ta puissance, en sainte magnificence. Du sein de l’aurore te [viendra] la rosée de ta jeunesse","poem":1},{"noteId":345},{"text":".","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"L’Éternel a juré, et il ne se repentira point : Tu es sacrificateur pour toujours, selon l’ordre de Melchisédec.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Le Seigneur, à ta droite, brisera les rois au jour de sa colère.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Il jugera parmi les nations, il remplira [tout] de corps morts, il brisera le chef d’un","poem":1},{"noteId":346},{"text":"grand pays.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Il boira du torrent dans le chemin, c’est pourquoi il lèvera haut la tête.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":344,"caller":"a","text":"voir Exode 4. 2, 17.","reference":{"chapter":110,"verse":2}},{"noteId":345,"caller":"b","text":"dans le sens de : tes jeunes gens.","reference":{"chapter":110,"verse":3}},{"noteId":346,"caller":"c","text":"litt. : sur un.","reference":{"chapter":110,"verse":6}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/fra_jnd/PSA/110.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/fra_jnd/PSA/111.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/fra_jnd/PSA/109.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":7}